{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_2_level_main_02-10_beg","groupId":"main_2","stageId":"main_02-10","title":"너무 늦어버린","storyCode":"2-10","avgTag":"작전 전","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_02-10_beg.txt","sourceHash":"7b496dc81fb8d26fa93302c8140c5915eefd467011d0e8c93bc0ee684807fa86","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"로도스 아일랜드를 크게 밀어붙이는 스컬슈레더.\n아미야는 스컬슈레더의 증오 섞인 질책과 질문에도 당돌하게 자신의 소신을 밝힌다. 이젠 정면으로 승부할 때다.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_r"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"리스캄! 방어선은 아직 버틸 만해?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"그래, 문제없다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"프란카, 양쪽에서 들어오는 공격에 주의해라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"정말 끝도 없이 몰려오네…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"이 견고한 방어를 돌파할 수 있을 것 같나!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"이렇게 네놈들을 날려버…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"으윽?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"으, 으아아아아!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"저, 저게 뭐지?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"테르밋 블레이드야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"방패째로 베어버려도, 네 견고한 방어를 돌파한 셈이 되려나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"정말이지…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"의료부! 여기 부상자가 있어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"이송 중엔 충격을 주지 않도록!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메딕 오퍼레이터","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"알고 있습니다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"그쪽은 어때?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"조금 껄끄러운 상황이야."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"프란카 씨…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"적 지휘관이… 저와 리스캄 씨 앞에 나타났어요!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"어디로 숨을 셈이지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"도망칠 순 없을 거다, 로도스 아일랜드."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"너희를 산산이 조각내서…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"…가루로 만들어주마."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"이… 감염자의 배신자들!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"어머, 드디어 나타나셨네. 저 녀석…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"등장 대사가 너무 진부하긴 하지만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야, 아무래도…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"앗, 막다른 곳이야!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"너무 많이 왔나?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"프란카 쪽도 그렇게 됐나…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"아무래도 우릴 막다른 곳으로 몰아넣은 모양이군."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"강행 돌파할 수밖에 없겠어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"우리 또한 적을 궤멸시킬 수 있는 전력을 보유하고 있다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"조금만 힘을 쓰면…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"그게 아니지, 뭘 모르네 리스캄은."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프란카","speakerId":"char_106_franka","isRemote":false,"text":"지금 우리 전력이 문제가 아니야. 근위국에 피해를 주는 상황은 무조건 피해야 한다니까?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"어쨌든 가만히 앉아서 당하고만 있을 수는 없다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리스캄","speakerId":"char_107_liskam","isRemote":false,"text":"디펜더팀, 방어 진형!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"로도스 아일랜드의 리더… 인가."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"감염자의 신분으로 용문의 손을 빌려, 같은 감염자에게 고통을 주다니."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"동포들의 목숨값은 네놈들의 피로 치러줘야겠다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스컬슈레더","speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","isRemote":false,"text":"가라!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"리유니온…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"먼저 원한을 품고, 먼저 다른 사람들을 다치게 하고, 먼저 폭력을 행사한 건……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"체르노보그에 있던 당신들이잖아요!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["아미야"]},{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["리유니온 멤버"]},{"speakerId":"char_106_franka","aliases":["프란카"]},{"speakerId":"char_107_liskam","aliases":["리스캄"]},{"speakerId":"char_1500_skulsr","aliases":["스컬슈레더"]}]}
